      "description": "Uses inventory_has because crafting an oak_button from oak_planks at the crafting table places the resulting oak_button item into the player's inventory. The player starts with no oak_button, so having ≥1 confirms the craft was completed. This is preferred over craft_item event tracking since inventory_has is the most direct check.",
